                        <div> <strong>Key Advantage:</strong>
                            <p>ACFM eliminates the single largest cost driver in offshore structural inspection—surface preparation and coating removal/restoration. Typical offshore jacket node inspection: traditional MPI requires $50K-200K in scaffolding, grit blasting, inspection, and recoating; ACFM performs same inspection for $10K-30K in-situ with no coating disturbance—ROI exceeds 5:1 on large platforms.</p>
