                                <h3>Marine Vessel & Ship Hull Inspection</h3>
                                <p>Commercial vessels, naval ships, and offshore support vessels experience fatigue cracking at hull-to-deck connections, hatch corners, bulkhead penetrations, and propulsion system mounts. ACFM enables in-water hull inspection and internal structural surveys through paint and marine fouling without drydocking—dramatically reducing inspection costs and vessel downtime for commercial fleets, naval readiness, and offshore construction vessels.</p>
