                                <h3>Industrial Plant & Infrastructure</h3>
                                <p>Refineries, petrochemical plants, power stations, and civil infrastructure experience weld fatigue, stress corrosion cracking (SCC), and hydrogen-induced cracking (HIC) in critical structural connections. ACFM inspects through fireproofing, insulation, and protective coatings without disruptive removal—enabling in-service inspection of operating facilities, maintaining production continuity, and eliminating asbestos/lead paint abatement costs for aging infrastructure.</p>
